t/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-865900832"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 17, 2013 at 6:46 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-754055636578512639</id><published>2013-01-16T20:35:37.929-07:00</published><updated>2013-01-16T20:35:37.929-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Great job Will, a despicable bunch that parades th...</title><content type='html'>Great job Will, a despicable bunch that parades their vice with immunity. My father has been a police officer for almost 20 years and the funny thing that I remember him saying to me as a kid was, &amp;quot;What&amp;#39;s the biggest gang in America?&amp;quot; to which I replied, &amp;quot;I don&amp;#39;t know, the Bloods?&amp;quot; and he answered, &amp;quot;No, it&amp;#39;s law enforcement.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I think he hit the nail on the head, just not in the way he may have meant it.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/191364236628864696/comments/default/754055636578512639'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/191364236628864696/comments/default/754055636578512639'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/01/from-undercover-narco-creeper-to-police.html?showComment=1358393737929#c754055636578512639' title=''/><author><name>R.S. Ladwig</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13487404072546513179</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='31' height='21' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-RBVU0hcnk6I/UMePSiDXvVI/AAAAAAAAApw/rR8083Oz4gI/s220/DSC_1098.JPG'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/01/from-undercover-narco-creeper-to-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-191364236628864696' sourc